<title>UK: FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts' estimates of UK company results expected in week ending March 28 include -</p>
<p>COMPANY----------------PFT/DIV/EPS--CONSENSUS----RANGE-------PVS</p>
<p>THURSDAY, March 27</p>
<p> Redland	F	     PFT    249.0    212.0-261.0	355.0</p>
<p>				  DIV    16.67    16.67-17.0	 16.67</p>
<p>				  EPS    21.0	19.2-22.2	  26.2</p>
<p>(TED - PFT range 212.0-308.0; PFT 257.0; DIV 16.7; EPS 21.8)</p>
<p> Hepworth     F	     PFT     66.8     63.0-74.0	  74.5</p>
